<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20013" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βῐ-ώσκομαι</span></b> , causal of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιόω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quicken,
				make</i> or <i>keep alive</i>, once in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> in aor., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺ γάρ μ᾽ ἐβιώσαο, κούρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.468
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιόσσαο</span>: the
			pres. occurs in the compd. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβιώσκομαι</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later in pass. sensc, <i>rcvive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕτεροι τόποι βιώσκονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					351a35
				</span></i>
			; simply, <i>live</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιωσαμένῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.2100
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιώσκεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Ind.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
